'''C. Honda''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 576
|rarity = SR
|name1 = C. Honda
|name2 = C. Honda CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''C. Honda CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This cat is designed to be used as an anti-Angel tanker. He is especially effective against [[Angelic Sleipnir]] and [[Sunfish Jones]] due to their knockback and slow abilities respectively. However, Angels are often spammed, so C. Honda's long recharge time is a massive barrier to its effective use. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] essentially does the same job but better even without considering [[Talents]] and the boost from duplicates, due to its stats being much higher relative to cost and recharge time.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker}}

